{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "This week, I will have worked remotely for overseas companies for a 5 years.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c3e625b5380715d7c7da7787375f8451a2177d6f6656c31572c41ac1dbdc24a7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.18], [6, 1.18, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.84], [8, 1.84, 2.28], [9, 2.28, 2.78], [10, 2.78, 3.06], [13, 3.38, 3.9]]}, {"text": "The first company was Zugata, an HR tech startup.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/1f47209d3be4efb668b431fbf9f01360910a0aa228dfeafddf2e46291316eea0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.74], [5, 2.1, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.46], [7, 2.46, 2.72], [8, 2.72, 3.14]]}, {"text": "I worked remotely from Vietnam with my peers and manager based in Palo Alto, California.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d536213b586083c3edf90211066127a62c8678a48754fca4ba7522f45d731ab3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.1], [9, 2.3, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.36], [13, 3.36, 3.6], [14, 3.76, 4.28]]}, {"text": "The second (and current) company is Grab.com, the Uber+Banking for Southeast Asia.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/ec6d3116de670cfae211c4226a3e2a71f43c1626ccada9eddcfdc251e3a9b2e5.mp3"}, {"text": "I work in Seattle and communicate daily with teams in Bengaluru, India, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia, and Singapore.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/f4a1c845659b0026bd3d1f92d7128b2f34743267d2494089f93cccca0e231329.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 2.0], [7, 2.0, 2.28], [8, 2.28, 2.6], [9, 2.6, 2.84], [11, 3.66, 4.08], [12, 4.08, 4.84], [13, 4.84, 5.3], [14, 5.6, 5.9], [15, 6.3, 6.34], [16, 6.34, 6.72]]}, {"text": "As many know or suspect, communication with a 12-hour delay is not efficient.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/140e5f355eeb9ab0b4fe7afc1ce4a2af195c3e8adb04c3aab4353e15d2af8387.mp3"}, {"text": "Miscommunications or lack of communication adds at least a 1-day delay (more for weekends and holidays), therefore thoughtful and intentional communication is critical for career success.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/68b4a28085c83cf1fd9c8db87179daa55091ebc49be24e4489227f1035f35e58.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 1.04], [1, 1.04, 1.48], [2, 1.48, 1.82], [3, 1.82, 1.98], [4, 1.98, 2.64], [5, 2.64, 3.06], [6, 3.06, 3.22], [7, 3.22, 3.32], [8, 3.32, 3.52], [10, 3.88, 4.24], [11, 4.58, 4.78], [12, 4.78, 4.94], [13, 4.94, 5.2], [14, 5.2, 5.46], [15, 5.46, 5.9], [16, 6.36, 6.54], [17, 6.54, 7.06], [18, 7.06, 7.3], [19, 7.3, 7.7], [20, 7.7, 8.3], [21, 8.3, 8.64], [22, 8.64, 9.0], [23, 9.0, 9.26], [24, 9.26, 9.56], [25, 9.56, 9.88]]}, {"text": "In the early days of my career, people wouldn’t answer my questions, not trust what I was sharing, or take forever to respond.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/65a9fe0ce36612f7791d0fb9f3d9e95e6f9923f488f4fcbab23e57c90b2a39f0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [2, 0.18, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.8], [5, 0.8, 0.94], [6, 0.94, 1.36], [7, 1.66, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.44], [10, 2.44, 2.6], [11, 2.6, 3.2], [12, 3.54, 3.66], [13, 3.66, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.08], [15, 4.08, 4.18], [16, 4.18, 4.3], [17, 4.3, 4.62], [19, 5.02, 5.22], [20, 5.22, 5.5], [21, 5.5, 5.8], [22, 5.8, 6.1]]}, {"text": "From these experiences, I developed the following writing style for Slack to mitigate communication gaps and speed up my project deliveries.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/148f80b3f554fe506defe18da8eeea8b2cd2febc1bd9721b0bd356c319df12b5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.98], [3, 1.5, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 1.82], [5, 1.82, 2.06], [6, 2.06, 2.38], [7, 2.38, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 3.04], [9, 3.04, 3.28], [10, 3.28, 3.54], [11, 3.54, 3.76], [12, 3.76, 4.08], [13, 4.08, 4.8], [14, 4.8, 5.1], [15, 5.1, 5.46], [16, 5.46, 5.7], [17, 5.7, 5.84], [18, 5.84, 5.98], [19, 5.98, 6.3], [20, 6.3, 6.72]]}, {"text": "I want to share 5 Slack writing techniques that I have learned when communicating with my peers in a 12+ hour timezone and at the very end, I share my writing template for how I structure most of my async communication (email or slack).", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/b30630f78794b2df65326d10b6df64964d6942d27d49f9472a5c6fdba064ad60.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.74], [5, 1.1, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.74], [11, 2.74, 2.94], [12, 2.94, 3.18], [13, 3.18, 3.66], [14, 3.66, 3.9], [15, 3.9, 4.06], [16, 4.06, 4.4], [17, 4.4, 4.62], [18, 4.62, 4.68], [19, 4.68, 4.92], [20, 5.22, 5.52], [22, 6.5, 6.7], [23, 6.7, 6.78], [24, 6.78, 6.9], [25, 6.9, 7.14], [26, 7.14, 7.56], [27, 7.82, 7.88], [28, 7.88, 8.12], [29, 8.12, 8.28], [30, 8.28, 8.56], [31, 8.56, 8.96], [32, 8.96, 9.18], [33, 9.18, 9.34], [34, 9.34, 9.48], [35, 9.48, 9.84], [36, 9.84, 10.18], [37, 10.18, 10.34], [38, 10.34, 10.54], [39, 10.54, 10.94], [40, 10.94, 11.66], [42, 12.48, 12.72], [43, 12.72, 13.02]]}, {"text": "Summary", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/8d83637eb79ecc1a98edcc2e8e2297c3bfa979dd04cf678a93b65efb74f40023.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.6]]}, {"text": "Know your audience.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/4ac148565aad91124fe98c043bf47044f7d53e172c4784438afc7c48d52bd976.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.82]]}, {"text": "Be concise.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/685f383cd38d21a067825677253c61fb2731cd7d8a064d25d5b046786cf56541.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.66]]}, {"text": "Speak with confidence.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/345b1f6cb6d1c7395c59d54aef3370ed9b7bb6ff37aeaa43a178b675090f46e3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.94]]}, {"text": "Know your goals.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/05329c566ad30a2632394edd9ee6195e160b4f8a4021f465dd6991fce63d8e24.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.72]]}, {"text": "Use this template.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/58c376577a7ee1f2fb0fb21c79ebea399c49d042102e61f60478426ee8c02013.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.88]]}, {"text": "Know your audience", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c110559b7f8e33fdc16aad05f0bb6e580291136d34efdde9f5574762e9429497.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.98]]}, {"text": "Follow-up questions instantly delay projects by +1 days.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/1b022a3dc962b51960719e2ace73ed5366a2199622f6e8a296c27e3756193500.mp3"}, {"text": "Know your audience and provide the context they need to answer your questions.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/a957a0a47928b41527c5dbf9f15ef18ca18d4c58589f92a23d225447b987be72.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.2], [8, 2.2, 2.4], [9, 2.4, 2.64], [10, 2.64, 2.9], [11, 2.9, 3.06], [12, 3.06, 3.48]]}, {"text": "Avoid acronyms, because you never know if they know them.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/ae92cd8d34ccf2a413ff0318bffa60e2b921a798a8a3357a9aaa6d7720520f92.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 1.02], [2, 1.02, 1.26], [3, 1.26, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 1.84], [6, 1.84, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.12], [8, 2.12, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.56]]}, {"text": "Define proper nouns, that they might not be familiar with.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/056830e9ab1afb6a791fa37ff4ccc0efdbb44b4933fbcbee6478d2fef2ff5ab1.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.44, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.48], [4, 1.48, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.28], [8, 2.28, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 3.0]]}, {"text": "For example, “The Obi-Wan service has high latency” is bad, b/c they might not know what Obi-Wan is.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/affd5de9e4666197b93d33572800d23bf363fa8819973aefbedbf2c054c9dcd7.mp3"}, {"text": "Be Concise", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/e3edf7dafdc043dd410dceaaff14c60268482250816b68ffa8944ad54f807d1b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.62]]}, {"text": "When your peer wakes up at 6am, they do not want to see an essay-length slack message.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/5dbc322da3af9897969cf1ef5f013f6c13235e72ece05e4238288996a9c2e93f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 2.06], [7, 2.52, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 2.98], [10, 2.98, 3.2], [11, 3.2, 3.38], [12, 3.38, 3.56], [13, 3.56, 3.82], [16, 4.72, 5.1]]}, {"text": "The message will be marked as “read” with the intention of responding later, but quickly forgotten.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/9d64f81a77b5093959e776b3c4177fdff98a1ec34d99fb4a4976e5222ea36248.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.26], [7, 1.94, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.54], [10, 2.54, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 3.16], [12, 3.16, 3.58], [13, 3.58, 3.76], [14, 3.76, 4.1], [15, 4.1, 4.44]]}, {"text": "Remove filler words or phrases.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/65f3c62b2d18a1c713741677f7eb09e6a3dd8857151de19e1aef557c34157eeb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.14], [3, 1.14, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.8]]}, {"text": "(For example, “By the way…”, “I was wondering about…”)", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c645410498d8bf9b932943e6ff3ca1bbcfd3cdc91698dfee9bb4c554239d9f06.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.64], [2, 1.26, 1.42], [3, 1.42, 1.54], [4, 1.54, 1.84], [6, 2.86, 3.0], [7, 3.0, 3.26], [8, 3.26, 4.08]]}, {"text": "Speak with confidence.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/345b1f6cb6d1c7395c59d54aef3370ed9b7bb6ff37aeaa43a178b675090f46e3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.94]]}, {"text": "“I think that I can possibly consider agreeing” 👉 🗑️.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/3cd4de58ec41abaf35d9d3f4ede09f4e03d8a8db91d97309c2b30d62f6aaa035.mp3"}, {"text": "Don’t share weak decisions or opinions.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/738389912ed990fe3680eeee526070c3127866056f85874a395e941b230af953.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.98]]}, {"text": "Either agree, or disagree.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/a974584ddfa9c3b19f7b4708265ca89f291bd084f448690265205aaf6a6428fb.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.36, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.34]]}, {"text": "Avoid phrases like, “I think…” b/c everything you write is what you think.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/8f88632cfab2bd75a15640d166390a622dcc38b60c5c57e4b4e61b44c1a4d11a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 0.84], [2, 0.84, 1.18], [4, 1.84, 2.14], [6, 3.28, 3.88], [7, 3.88, 4.12], [8, 4.12, 4.3], [9, 4.3, 4.54], [10, 4.54, 4.68], [11, 4.68, 4.82], [12, 4.82, 5.08]]}, {"text": "no need to double explain.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/040132bac64d4c17a556ad2b251bb6eab80b10dfe16ffc48fd9dc77f54102ffb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.22]]}, {"text": "Offer a summary.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d9104c0ac04aaa1c07efb6057981c084eaafe1cd1ee5ee49b271fe8070e35803.mp3"}, {"text": "If the message must be long, include a summary to help the reader prioritize when they need to respond.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/0e3f3d39fcf885c8afad92e7803364c5616b981238f96d26a1ca813bb8450ffb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.38], [6, 1.52, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.56], [11, 2.56, 2.76], [12, 2.76, 2.96], [13, 2.96, 3.54], [14, 3.54, 3.94], [15, 3.94, 4.1], [16, 4.1, 4.22], [17, 4.22, 4.38], [18, 4.38, 4.68]]}, {"text": "Do your homework.", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/0ff006daba141ffd439ec09bc1bbe7ac1e7781edf82a12f053a2d559e0b09b55.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.64]]}, {"text": "If you’re not confident about an assumption, do your own research before stating facts or asking for help.", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c1aefc6b8b94f66659c849b56355856e005f7b66d4c64fbc52c901eaf04565e7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.78], [7, 2.28, 2.36], [8, 2.36, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 3.2], [11, 3.2, 3.68], [12, 3.68, 4.18], [13, 4.18, 4.58], [14, 4.58, 4.98], [15, 4.98, 5.36], [16, 5.36, 5.58], [17, 5.58, 5.86]]}, {"text": "If the reader find a hole in your premise, then you lost a day regrouping.", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c8473e20585d10f79f5f50b43078e2f56f23c1a818787730c325d9bbadc36d55.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 2.04], [9, 2.52, 2.64], [10, 2.64, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 3.04], [12, 3.04, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.36], [14, 3.36, 4.0]]}, {"text": "Cite your sources.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/aa7a8f2a91df8f5db9f804762ed80053b05c2ed9a5ee52814ff88fc18b658e41.mp3"}, {"text": "If you weren’t confident about a key fact, perhaps your reader is too.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/716bd9278271a30cba5b096cd25c4d34268b49fbd73d61313f28eb5cd0f00343.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.82], [8, 2.12, 2.34], [9, 2.34, 2.58], [12, 2.84, 3.2]]}, {"text": "Link to the documentation relevant to your slack message.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/3614ebe8ff83ebcc7ec3f1702976fa37aed17a7541a49558c1b9c830e8a9692f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.64], [5, 1.64, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.22], [8, 2.22, 2.56]]}, {"text": "This serves two purposes: so the reader can dive deeper if they want, and so you can find your sources later if you need to dive deeper yourself.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/1523b5d5b8cf59cbd5e3f1e7cbb98e1d6b8253c7e724319c7d00e3257d9072b3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.98], [4, 1.32, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.32], [9, 2.32, 2.64], [10, 2.64, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.22], [13, 3.66, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.04], [15, 4.04, 4.22], [16, 4.22, 4.38], [17, 4.38, 4.58], [18, 4.58, 4.78], [19, 4.78, 5.1], [20, 5.1, 5.48], [21, 5.48, 5.72], [22, 5.72, 5.82], [23, 5.82, 5.96], [24, 5.96, 6.1], [25, 6.1, 6.28], [26, 6.28, 6.58], [27, 6.58, 6.9]]}, {"text": "Provide explicit, clear answers to questions.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/99b11959489909366225153a6159c6f5489b03f1736658d0f04e22ca4f15514d.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.32, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.24], [3, 1.24, 1.6], [4, 1.6, 1.88], [5, 1.88, 2.32]]}, {"text": "If someone asks you a Yes or No question.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/99fe39c14871d1cd6867cc5cd460be495c3e852c48e77f7d7bb0f92f8966c58d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.62], [7, 1.62, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.28]]}, {"text": "Respond with yes or no.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/84d2834388afc908fc53a7e8ca925a5dcf9436cf68cc4ba7bf58a8bead326531.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.28]]}, {"text": "Don’t make the reader guess.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/a7bbf16056d0a8740306bf4f1639304267b55aae73477757bd7eb24cb31445e0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.18]]}, {"text": "Clarify your needs", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/ee1559ff185e3551ae0720020f069f350675798e4bfc33eb00e34f29a89f9a32.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.4, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 1.08]]}, {"text": "Clearly state what you need from them.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/b28866e9e2b7dcb5ec3d90d26f31accbd36a00919cbae10b594cfa551ff10e05.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.62]]}, {"text": "Often my peers will intertwine questions in context or not be explicit with their needs.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/33645ae3d5297681a54b043eee94bf9665c096cb791d4b0b672ee2a0436a8fee.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.58], [5, 1.58, 2.04], [7, 2.32, 2.74], [8, 2.74, 3.06], [9, 3.06, 3.26], [10, 3.26, 3.48], [11, 3.48, 3.98], [12, 3.98, 4.2], [13, 4.2, 4.34], [14, 4.34, 4.56]]}, {"text": "I’ve seen people (intentionally or unintentionally) avoid answering critical questions, b/c they “missed” them.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c8a788749173c33a9b30a63e6e7ade280897a6fb3c208b8143c685efdc4c0abc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 2.02], [5, 2.02, 2.86], [6, 2.86, 3.38], [7, 3.38, 3.88], [8, 3.88, 4.24], [9, 4.24, 5.0], [11, 6.04, 6.28], [13, 6.56, 6.84]]}, {"text": "Provide the reader enough context to meet your goals.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/1d35de64c0dd37b585dda8ad861c298b04fc3cc689e54c0a093165fd80606a57.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.16]]}, {"text": "Speak in the open", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/28986f058ea4005cb8f2b3497b5fb0694695c99de84e0ffc1f1269d1877f0e7e.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.22, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.5], [3, 0.5, 0.8]]}, {"text": "Public topics should be in public channels and private topics should be in private DMs.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/3d673c231bb46d1df9056a54b2caf2ec34f28667a69493de3d63f67c26b1b95a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.82], [8, 2.12, 2.44], [9, 2.44, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.16], [11, 3.16, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.94], [14, 3.94, 4.64]]}, {"text": "Almost every private conversation about a project needs input from other people.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/1894a2d6f7abc3c75204e98e6de15fe6fb8c4e52d2b45131236998f089e7aa95.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.5], [4, 1.5, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 2.3], [7, 2.3, 2.64], [8, 2.64, 3.0], [9, 3.0, 3.2], [10, 3.2, 3.4], [11, 3.4, 3.72]]}, {"text": "Having these conversations in open channels will help future people joining the project have access to earlier discussions.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/942bfb975a1fff6e6d7c2b202d6d13526cfef929c3fa790cd127588c844a604b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [2, 0.46, 0.94], [4, 1.16, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.38], [9, 2.38, 2.74], [10, 2.74, 2.98], [11, 2.98, 3.14], [12, 3.14, 3.48], [13, 3.48, 3.7], [14, 3.7, 3.96], [15, 3.96, 4.18], [16, 4.18, 4.42], [17, 4.42, 4.92]]}, {"text": "Open channels are also searchable.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/f3d9a8b9432aae71a06f63082f7e49797a5fcf24be3ea176ed29ae57b83954e9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.72], [2, 0.72, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.84]]}, {"text": "I always move project conversations from private DMs to public channels, b/c of the time, other people will need to be involved.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/9fbc6616d6f74e9f484d0e46982e1ab08e9fc57ba19fae351aabd131763d8dd0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.86], [5, 1.86, 2.28], [6, 2.28, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 3.2], [8, 3.2, 3.32], [9, 3.32, 3.6], [10, 3.6, 4.04], [12, 5.12, 5.22], [13, 5.22, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.62], [15, 6.1, 6.26], [16, 6.26, 6.52], [17, 6.52, 6.68], [18, 6.68, 6.82], [19, 6.82, 6.96], [20, 6.96, 7.06], [21, 7.06, 7.46]]}, {"text": "Use this template", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/0c23e98d09cc6f4fe662dde698fbd0b2b7e32a183ae9f154da2e042a5942e9f8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.88]]}, {"text": "greeting: Hi team,", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/daf0a6d85862f49ab118caf1077379310867f3b72aab45c45c2cbfecd9ac3d8f.mp3"}, {"text": "TLDR: If my message gets long, I will include a 1-line Too Long; Didn’t Read to help the reader decide if they actually want to read my message now if it can wait until later.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/39a8ac7c9dc7822bbb3105b2c400cbd5f38b12281edc08c91ac4e2ecc5bccf80.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.78], [1, 1.3, 1.66], [2, 1.66, 1.8], [3, 1.8, 2.12], [4, 2.12, 2.4], [5, 2.4, 2.72], [6, 3.28, 3.34], [7, 3.34, 3.46], [8, 3.46, 3.78], [9, 3.78, 4.0], [11, 4.38, 4.7], [12, 4.7, 5.24], [13, 5.66, 6.14], [14, 6.14, 6.32], [15, 6.32, 6.52], [16, 6.52, 6.64], [17, 6.64, 6.8], [18, 6.8, 6.98], [19, 6.98, 7.36], [20, 7.36, 7.62], [21, 7.62, 7.7], [22, 7.7, 8.06], [23, 8.06, 8.3], [24, 8.3, 8.46], [25, 8.46, 8.6], [26, 8.6, 8.76], [27, 8.76, 9.08], [28, 9.08, 9.44], [29, 9.44, 9.68], [30, 9.68, 9.8], [31, 9.8, 9.92], [32, 9.92, 10.1], [33, 10.1, 10.4], [34, 10.4, 10.7]]}, {"text": "Context and the problem: Here I provide context to the problem, assuming they have no idea what I am talking about.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/7d2cd24f7ed63a855933c784e05dbc3f7633055b9b527e9486104cfd19307987.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.6], [1, 0.6, 0.84], [2, 0.84, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.32], [4, 1.72, 1.9], [6, 2.12, 2.36], [7, 2.36, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 3.1], [9, 3.1, 3.2], [10, 3.2, 3.62], [11, 3.92, 4.24], [12, 4.24, 4.56], [13, 4.56, 4.78], [14, 4.78, 4.98], [15, 4.98, 5.38], [16, 5.38, 5.76], [17, 5.76, 5.86], [18, 5.86, 5.94], [19, 5.94, 6.24], [20, 6.24, 6.56]]}, {"text": "I do not want them to ask follow-up questions, because those add delays.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/dc6f259029919d135c4114ea46225b6e375e68c8cd365de5607d59735a217df1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.1], [1, 0.1, 0.2], [2, 0.2, 0.38], [3, 0.38, 0.56], [4, 0.56, 0.7], [5, 0.7, 0.86], [6, 0.86, 1.14], [8, 1.58, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.72], [11, 2.72, 2.96], [12, 2.96, 3.26]]}, {"text": "I do not use acronyms.", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c594ce8273fbcdbb58a451ab9075c317fbae3992454351f7461760f87bc576b0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.24], [2, 0.24, 0.4], [3, 0.4, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 1.28]]}, {"text": "end: A clear, ordered list of questions, sorted to match the context.", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/034471068c3edb6bdb39949ca7c755388043f306c90e0f8903cb90b0dbb04f16.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.7, 0.8], [2, 0.8, 1.08], [4, 1.42, 1.72], [5, 1.72, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.32], [7, 2.32, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 3.02], [9, 3.02, 3.24], [10, 3.24, 3.42], [11, 3.42, 3.78]]}, {"text": "Question 1", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/3958d8e5574c7126b598cea7b7754203ab428ec6555b818e14be904584681ab9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44]]}, {"text": "Question 2", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/ba5d6297d323c5e34692a7265de2aaf3bd0ccfb7ac8d83b8c3e454cd84eab2e6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.42, 0.8]]}, {"text": "Example", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/6c2ee3d7548a12563ac63941a2108fc7129bbf258d99a5f21db7a7aeda57470a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58]]}, {"text": "Hi team,", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/f717e0766a5825646d543443204eb9523cc37567462dfa47e2422af0572e170c.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.24, 0.64]]}, {"text": "The latency graph (dasboard link) to our messaging service (code link) from your service (client code link) increased > 15% week over week.", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/d81487f711d72d84c04a3b67e69fad56546c46cb9fcfebdbd8a0fe6ca126d4ea.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [2, 0.5, 0.88], [4, 1.44, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 1.92], [6, 1.92, 2.06], [7, 2.06, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.88], [9, 3.46, 3.6], [10, 3.6, 3.96], [11, 4.24, 4.38], [12, 4.38, 4.54], [13, 4.54, 4.9], [14, 4.9, 5.34], [15, 5.34, 5.66], [16, 5.66, 6.0], [17, 6.0, 6.42], [19, 6.42, 6.98], [20, 7.3, 7.54], [21, 7.54, 7.74], [22, 7.74, 7.98]]}, {"text": "We have not made any deployments in 2 weeks (deployment log link) or configuration changes > (configuration dashboard link).", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/4dc56d8e3145c3a9cf68aa3467c3a3085a41be1eb877fb02d85db2785c099c4e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.6], [8, 1.78, 2.08], [10, 2.62, 2.86], [11, 2.86, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.72], [13, 3.72, 4.28], [14, 4.28, 4.92], [16, 5.68, 5.98], [17, 5.98, 6.52], [18, 6.52, 6.92]]}, {"text": "Has anything changed with the amount of traffic or size of the payload from your system?", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/c80b97273e2c0aed728908e83617ce93885e7967865457c40abbce142c83866a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 1.04], [3, 1.04, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.02], [11, 3.02, 3.14], [12, 3.14, 3.52], [13, 3.52, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 3.94], [15, 3.94, 4.34]]}, {"text": "Is there someone that can help me investigate this?", "block": 40, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/8c6dcd30b6b6c06bda8b5bf1afd4c973b1ce730276f5082343e3697e2b492e68.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.28], [7, 1.28, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 2.04]]}, {"text": "In this example, I assume whoever is on-call knows (almost) nothing about their teams’ integration with my team’s servers.", "block": 41, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/6d2c030f7dac26c8397b77660bf1ff24b85ce4eb2e0e3e56b5c022b2b2104d6f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.84], [3, 1.08, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.74], [6, 1.74, 2.08], [8, 2.48, 2.88], [10, 3.56, 4.02], [11, 4.02, 4.32], [12, 4.32, 4.5], [13, 4.5, 4.84], [14, 4.84, 5.3], [15, 5.3, 5.58], [16, 5.58, 5.72], [18, 5.96, 6.36]]}, {"text": "If you have more tips you want to share, send me an email kevin@sparkstart.io", "block": 42, "audio": "../../../../../assets/blog-audio/bde1c41ebb3d4cb57ab105540582569635e8f490e0b8368633a9d756f5833ac1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.28], [7, 1.28, 1.38], [8, 1.38, 1.68], [9, 2.12, 2.28], [10, 2.28, 2.46], [11, 2.46, 2.58], [12, 2.58, 3.0]]}]}